# Map tiles (baked in at build time). Leave unset to use the defaults:
#   streets:   Esri World Street Map (street names in English and Georgian)
#   satellite: Esri World Imagery + Esri place labels
# Example with a MapTiler key (restrict the key to your domain in the MapTiler dashboard):
# VITE_STREETS_TILE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2/256/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY
# VITE_STREETS_ATTRIBUTION=© MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors
# VITE_SATELLITE_TILE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/satellite/256/{z}/{x}/{y}.jpg?key=YOUR_KEY
# VITE_SATELLITE_ATTRIBUTION=© MapTiler © Maxar
# Set to empty to turn off the label overlay on satellite:
# VITE_LABELS_TILE_URL=
# If you change tile hosts, add them to the server's TILE_ORIGINS too (e.g. https://api.maptiler.com).
